        "How this conversation came to have a Talk room. 'created' means Hermiq created the room for this session and the agent treats every human message in it as a turn. 'bound' means Hermiq was invited into, or delivered a report into, a room somebody else owns, and the mention gate applies. Unset is treated as 'bound', which is the pre-existing behaviour, so no backfill is required.": "How this conversation came to have a Talk room. 'created' means Hermiq created the room for this session and the agent treats every human message in it as a turn. 'bound' means Hermiq was invited into, or delivered a report into, a room somebody else owns, and the mention gate applies. Unset is treated as 'bound', which is the pre-existing behaviour, so no backfill is required.",
