        "When true, a due run does not execute automatically — the dispatcher creates a pending Approval and notifies the reviewer; the run proceeds only after approval (EU AI Act Art. 14 human oversight).": "When true, a due run does not execute automatically — the dispatcher creates a pending Approval and notifies the reviewer; the run proceeds only after approval (EU AI Act Art. 14 human oversight).",
        "When true, a failed run is retried with exponential backoff (up to retryMaxAttempts) before being marked dead-letter (run-reliability).": "When true, a failed run is retried with exponential backoff (up to retryMaxAttempts) before being marked dead-letter (run-reliability).",
        "When true, a valid trigger does not run the agent automatically — a pending Approval (sourceType=webhook) is created and the reviewer notified; the run proceeds only after approval (EU AI Act Art. 14 human oversight).": "When true, a valid trigger does not run the agent automatically — a pending Approval (sourceType=webhook) is created and the reviewer notified; the run proceeds only after approval (EU AI Act Art. 14 human oversight).",
        "When true, all agent runs for this organisation are halted.": "When true, all agent runs for this organisation are halted.",
        "When true, the composer offers a hands-free conversation control beside the microphone: your turn is sent automatically when you stop speaking, the reply is spoken, and the microphone reopens. Defaults to false because auto-sending on a silence turns a pause for thought into a sent message, which is a reasonable trade only where someone chose it. Dictation (microphone) and conversation (headset) are separate controls precisely so that pressing one never does the other.": "When true, the composer offers a hands-free conversation control beside the microphone: your turn is sent automatically when you stop speaking, the reply is spoken, and the microphone reopens. Defaults to false because auto-sending on a silence turns a pause for thought into a sent message, which is a reasonable trade only where someone chose it. Dictation (microphone) and conversation (headset) are separate controls precisely so that pressing one never does the other.",
        "When true, this agent cannot be reached as a sub-agent-delegation target — a delegation attempt is refused outright (delegation_requires_approval) rather than creating a pending Approval, since a delegate call has no synchronous pause/resume mechanism. The agent remains runnable via its own schedule or flow trigger, which enforce the full pending/approved/denied gate (mirrors Schedule.requiresApproval's EU AI Act Art. 14 semantics, applied here at the agent level for delegation targets).": "When true, this agent cannot be reached as a sub-agent-delegation target — a delegation attempt is refused outright (delegation_requires_approval) rather than creating a pending Approval, since a delegate call has no synchronous pause/resume mechanism. The agent remains runnable via its own schedule or flow trigger, which enforce the full pending/approved/denied gate (mirrors Schedule.requiresApproval's EU AI Act Art. 14 semantics, applied here at the agent level for delegation targets).",
        "When true, this agent may be conversed with from a Nextcloud Talk room in which the Hermiq bot is enabled. Defaults to false, and is only half of the requirement: a Talk moderator must ALSO enable the bot in the room, so neither switch alone activates the bridge and installing the feature changes no behaviour until an operator opts in deliberately.": "When true, this agent may be conversed with from a Nextcloud Talk room in which the Hermiq bot is enabled. Defaults to false, and is only half of the requirement: a Talk moderator must ALSO enable the bot in the room, so neither switch alone activates the bridge and installing the feature changes no behaviour until an operator opts in deliberately.",
        "Where the provider serving this feature must run. A run whose provider carries a different residency is refused before any request reaches it.": "Where the provider serving this feature must run. A run whose provider carries a different residency is refused before any request reaches it.",
        "Where the run output is delivered. talk/notification/none stay inside this Nextcloud instance. email (delivery-channels) sends the redacted output via OCP\\Mail\\IMailer. webhook (delivery-channels) POSTs the redacted, size-capped output to deliverTarget, HMAC-signed. Reaching a named chat platform (Slack/Matrix/Telegram/WhatsApp/Teams) is OpenConnector's job, not a Hermiq delivery channel — point webhook at an OpenConnector Source or an n8n webhook trigger.": "Where the run output is delivered. talk/notification/none stay inside this Nextcloud instance. email (delivery-channels) sends the redacted output via OCP\\Mail\\IMailer. webhook (delivery-channels) POSTs the redacted, size-capped output to deliverTarget, HMAC-signed. Reaching a named chat platform (Slack/Matrix/Telegram/WhatsApp/Teams) is OpenConnector's job, not a Hermiq delivery channel — point webhook at an OpenConnector Source or an n8n webhook trigger.",
